claim.claim-text:
a base (414) defining a fluid path (450) therethrough such that the fluid path (450) is fluidly coupled between a first space and a second space;
a traveler structure (412) coupled to the base (414);
an energy storage device (420) disposed between the traveler structure (412) and the base (414);
a restraining element (425) that restrains the energy storage device (420) in a stored energy condition, where the restraining element (425) is configured to degrade such that degradation of the restraining element (425) releases the energy storage device (420) from the stored energy condition to move the traveler structure (412) away from the base (414).
